How Nadali was in that era

00:01:46.833 --> 00:01:49.199
Acquiring such a strong realistic painting skills

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:52.200
You know, at that time, many schools did not teach

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:54.166
Many teachers can't draw by themselves

00:01:54.566 --> 00:01:56.699
Dali said he was largely self-taught

00:01:56.700 --> 00:01:57.700
he wrote

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:00.000
My life is strictly limited to studying

00:02:00.133 --> 00:02:01.166
I don't go shopping

00:02:01.166 --> 00:02:02.199
not going to the cinema

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.533
I go out just from apartment to school

00:02:04.533 --> 00:02:06.333
then return to the apartment from school

00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:09.333
He even lived in poverty like a Puritan

00:02:09.566 --> 00:02:11.866
Monthly Living Expenses Fantasy to Today

00:02:11.866 --> 00:02:12.666
that's probably

00:02:12.666 --> 00:02:14.599
It's about four to five hundred yuan.

00:02:14.733 --> 00:02:16.966
We can see Dali as an ascetic

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:19.333
I have been painting with my heart throughout my school life

00:02:19.333 --> 00:02:21.566
It's not because of how much he loves to paint

00:02:21.566 --> 00:02:23.299
It's because he's a jerk

00:02:23.533 --> 00:02:25.766
He was born in a Spanish upper class

00:02:25.766 --> 00:02:26.933
rich family

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:27.766
when he found out

00:02:27.766 --> 00:02:30.666
When the rich kids of the same class around me are playing

00:02:30.666 --> 00:02:31.966
to be different from them

00:02:31.966 --> 00:02:33.666
He made up his mind to study

00:02:33.766 --> 00:02:35.366
Because it's different for Dali

00:02:35.366 --> 00:02:37.099
an extraordinary need

00:02:37.333 --> 00:02:38.999
he wrote in his autobiography

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:42.366
I have this crazy need to feel different

00:02:42.366 --> 00:02:44.299
so that once I meet by chance

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.933
when put me in the same position as others

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:48.599
make me cry like crazy

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:51.133
no matter what the cost

00:02:51.200 --> 00:02:52.300
i am the only one

00:02:52.333 --> 00:02:53.699
I am unique

00:02:53.733 --> 00:02:55.099
i want to be independent

00:02:55.266 --> 00:02:56.600
so he won't give up on either

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:58.700
Unique opportunity to show yourself

00:02:58.733 --> 00:03:00.299
he is so desperate

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:02.100
different from the people around me

00:03:02.266 --> 00:03:03.466
strong desire

00:03:03.466 --> 00:03:06.399
What brings is involuntary uncontrollable

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:09.100
In an art defense after admission

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:10.766
this happened to him

00:03:10.766 --> 00:03:11.300
he wrote

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:13.133
my luck is unbelievable

00:03:13.133 --> 00:03:15.666
That's exactly what I like to talk about.

00:03:15.666 --> 00:03:18.033
But suddenly I was filled with a kind of

00:03:18.033 --> 00:03:19.566
irrepressible laziness

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:21.900
Stand up without hesitation

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:22.966
3 teachers

00:03:22.966 --> 00:03:25.466
Everyone in the classroom was stunned

00:03:25.466 --> 00:03:26.733
declared loudly

00:03:26.733 --> 00:03:27.499
Unfortunately

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:30.400
Because I am many times smarter than these 3 teachers

00:03:30.466 --> 00:03:32.766
so i refuse to take their test

00:03:32.766 --> 00:03:34.333
i know the subject too well

00:03:34.366 --> 00:03:36.366
It turned out I was taken to the Disciplinary Committee

00:03:36.366 --> 00:03:37.499
expelled from school

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.566
That's the end of my student life

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:42.600
And this kind of behavior Dali said he started when he was a child

00:03:42.666 --> 00:03:43.766
when he was in primary school

00:03:43.766 --> 00:03:45.300
to show that you are different

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:46.533
attract attention

00:03:46.533 --> 00:03:47.433
he used two dollars

00:03:47.433 --> 00:03:49.733
to buy a dollar coin from someone else

00:03:49.733 --> 00:03:52.266
And very happy to be called crazy

00:03:52.466 --> 00:03:53.899
no matter what the price

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.533
He must remain unique

00:03:55.566 --> 00:03:57.566
This is the whole life of Dali

00:03:57.566 --> 00:03:59.733
core motivation for all behavior

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:02.333
Because he was a child who was overly spoiled since he was a child

00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:03.299
he has a brother

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:05.400
Died of meningitis at age 7

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:06.200
dali was born

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.500
Make parents feel like the lost child is back

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:10.500
And he looks very much like his brother

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.100
Due to such a special experience

00:04:12.133 --> 00:04:14.166
He easily got from his parents

00:04:14.166 --> 00:04:15.966
Extraordinary attention and love

00:04:16.066 --> 00:04:16.866
According to him

00:04:16.866 --> 00:04:18.400
he could do whatever he wanted

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:19.199
do anything

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:21.066
no matter how bad he's done

00:04:21.066 --> 00:04:22.699
His parents will eventually forgive

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.366
and settle the consequences for him

00:04:24.366 --> 00:04:26.566
like he stabbed his nanny with a needle

00:04:26.566 --> 00:04:28.266
cruelty to animals and friends

00:04:28.366 --> 00:04:29.866
Looking at these behaviors today

00:04:29.866 --> 00:04:32.133
That must be sent to a psychiatric hospital

00:04:32.366 --> 00:04:34.799
This is the classic Mashlow's hierarchy of needs theory

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.266
When Dali was 6 years old

00:04:36.266 --> 00:04:38.333
He's already in that doting environment

00:04:38.333 --> 00:04:39.966
Meet the first 4 requirements

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.733
If a child's needs are met prematurely

00:04:42.733 --> 00:04:44.699
Then he must think about a question

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:47.166
it's about who i am

00:04:47.266 --> 00:04:48.466
this is from childhood

00:04:48.466 --> 00:04:50.099
the core problem he faced

00:04:50.366 --> 00:04:51.799
He wants to prove himself even more desperately

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:53.266
different from my dead brother

00:04:53.700 --> 00:05:01.533
My brother's body grips my heart

